FLUX 3 Image Klein prompt upsampler (flux-3-image-klein-pup)
https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-pup
License: Apache License 2.0
By default this application downloads only the official system prompts
(system_prompts.json) from that repository, and BFL's system prompts for external
LLMs (src/flux3/pup_prompts_external_vlm.json) from
https://github.com/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein (Apache License 2.0). Optionally (download_models.py --pup) it
downloads quantized builds of the upsampler for local use:
  - INT8 ConvRot build published by Black Forest Labs in
    https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy
  - Community Q4_K_M GGUF with its vision projector (Apache License 2.0):
    https://huggingface.co/rekuen/flux-3-image-klein-pup-GGUF

